OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Fri 27 NovC17:54/15
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMusk's plan to send a million SpaceX   
OL,4,Adata satellites into space approved    
OL,6,FUS regulators have given SpaceX the    
OL,7,Fgo-ahead to launch a million satellites
OL,8,Finto Earth's orbit to help build data  
OL,9,Fcentres in space - the first approval  
OL,10,Fof its kind.                           
OL,12,FThe company, which is owned by Elon    
OL,13,FMusk, wants to use sunlight to power   
OL,14,Fsatellites that will process data for  
OL,15,FAI and send the results back to Earth. 
OL,17,FThe Federal Communications Commission  
OL,18,F(FCC) said on Wednesday that the       
OL,19,Fproject, known as Starmind, would      
OL,20,F"support America's booming super       
OL,21,Fintelligence economy".                 
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
