OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Fri 27 NovC17:54/15
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMusk's plan to send a million SpaceX   
OL,4,Adata satellites into space approved    
OL,6,FHowever, rival firm Amazon has         
OL,7,Fcriticised it as a "lofty ambition     
OL,8,Frather than a real plan", while        
OL,9,Fastronomers in the US said the move    
OL,10,Fwould "significantly undermine" the    
OL,11,Fpublic's ability to study and observe  
OL,12,Fthe night sky.                         
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
