OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Fri 27 NovC17:54/15
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1           
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'We have no interest in hearing from   
OL,4,AHuw Edwards', Downing Street says      
OL,6,FThe prime minister's spokesperson has  
OL,7,Fsaid broadcasters must "act            
OL,8,Fresponsibly" and that "we have no      
OL,9,Finterest in hearing" what Huw Edwards  
OL,10,Fhas to say, following a backlash       
OL,11,Fagainst new interviews with the        
OL,12,Fdisgraced former BBC News presenter.   
OL,14,FEdwards, who was convicted in 2024 for 
OL,15,Fmaking indecent images of children, has
OL,16,Fbeen interviewed for a Channel 4       
OL,17,Fdocumentary plus a podcast by the      
OL,18,FObserver and Tortoise Media.           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
PS,C000
CT,25,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Fri 27 NovC17:54/15
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1           
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'We have no interest in hearing from   
OL,4,AHuw Edwards', Downing Street says      
OL,6,F"Our thoughts first and foremost will  
OL,7,Fbe with the victims of child sexual    
OL,8,Fabuse and exploitation. We have no     
OL,9,Finterest in hearing what he has to     
OL,10,Fsay," a Downing Street spokesperson    
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
OL,13,F"There are extremely serious crimes and
OL,14,Fanyone convicted of them must face the 
OL,15,Fconsequences of their actions."        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
