OL,3,AFive Gladiators will not return for new
OL,4,ABBC series                             
OL,6,FGladiators relaunched on the BBC in    
OL,7,F2024, having originally been aired on  
OL,8,FITV from 1992 until 2000, and then on  
OL,9,FSky between 2008 and 2009.             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
